  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Taurins Cottage is the perfect beach retreat for a family who wants to enjoy the best of what Rosemary has to offer. Situated on the corner of Rosemary Avenue and Boardwalk B, you will be just steps away from the beach, and merely a 5 minute walk down Rosemary Avenue to Barrett Square, where you can enjoy boutique shopping, fine dining and of course, the Sugar Shack, a local favorite for kids of all ages. <br><br>Taurins Cottage is a clean and calming refuge, that offers a relaxed at home feel. The master bedroom and adjoining bath are located on the first floor, along with two children’s bunk rooms, a second full bathroom and a laundry room. The fully stocked kitchen, breakfast bar and dining area are located upstairs, open to the family room with a large sectional sofa. This is a wonderful space for the whole family to gather after a day at the beach. Two additional bedrooms and a full bathroom are also located upstairs. <br><br>The wrap around balcony porch offers a a place to sit and relax as you take in the ocean view, while a private plunge pool is located in the home’s courtyard. The cooling plunge pool is a wonderful amenity to have after a day at the beach. During the cooler months, the pool can be heated for an additional fee. <br><br>If you're traveling with a nanny or adult children, you may also consider renting the Taurins Carriage House in conjunction with the Taurins Cottage, so they may enjoy their own private accommodations just outside of the main house across the courtyard. The Taurins Carriage House (VRBO 2164789) provides accommodations for 4. It offers a spacious open concept kitchen, dining and living room, as well as a bunk nook downstairs and a queen sized loft with privacy and lots of natural light upstairs. With its combination of white shiplap walls, high ceiling, warn wooden floors and eclectic mix of midcentury modern and rustic furniture, this boho-chic space provides a very cool beachy vibe. <br><br>*** PLEASE NOTE: PARKING CAN OCCASIONALLY BE A CHALLENGE IN ROSEMARY AS IT WAS DESIGNED TO BE A PEDESTRIAN COMMUNITY. IT OFFERS ONLY PUBLIC STREET PARKING AND IF YOU ARE TRAVELING IN MULTIPLE CARS, YOU MAY HAVE TO PARK A BLOCK FROM THE HOUSE AT TIMES. OUR GARAGE IS NOT ACCESSABLE FOR PARKING; HOWEVER, YOU MAY PARALLEL PARK IN FRONT OF THE GARAGE. THIS PARKING SPOT ACCOMMODATES ONE VEHICLE AND IS LIMITED FOR USE BY ONLY TAURINS COTTAGE GUESTS. ****<br><br>",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Rosemary Beach House on the Boardwalk...just steps from the beach!!!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
